\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Best-fit forward models for the Asal post-diking time series of Vigny et al.\ (2007). The EP00--DF00 baseline change (mm) is shown as filled circles with $1\sigma $ error bars. Solid curves show the best-fit Foulger diffusion model (red) and viscous step response (green); the dashed red curve shows the published Foulger fit of Vigny et al.\ (2007). All curves are referenced to the first measurement epoch ($t_{\mathrm  {ref}} \approx 1.1$~yr); see text for parameter values and goodness-of-fit statistics.}}{22}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
